  "name": "fy5253-nearest-wednesday-m02",
  "description": "pandas FY5253(weekday=2, startingMonth=2, variation='nearest'): the fiscal year ends on the Wednesday closest to the last day of month 2. Mapped to anchor edge end, month 2, day last, rule nearest, weeks start thursday; years named by year_number 'end', which the generator checked numbers every FY5253 year of the 400-year cycle 1700-2099 consecutively. Year bounds 2000-2030, and the fiscal year located on each year's last day and the next year's first day for 2024-2026. The subdivision is an arbitrary valid 4-4-5 pattern that no case asserts.",
